EPTUS ASTARTES unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>Until the attacking unit has finished making its attacks, each time an attack targets your unit, worsen the Armour Penetration characteristic of that attack by 1.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="anvil-siege-force-rigid-discipline" data-stratagem-type="strategic-ploy" data-source-label="STRATEGIC PLOY Stratagem"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="space-marines-stratagem-rigid-discipline">RIGID DISCIPLINE</button></h3><span class="stratagem-type">STRATEGIC PLOY Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>End of the Fight phase.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>One ADEPTUS ASTARTES unit from your army that is within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>Your unit can immediately make a Fall Back move of up to 6&quot;.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="restrictions"><b>Restrictions</b><br>When making that move, your unit must end that move either wholly within your deployment zone or within range of an objective marker.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="anvil-siege-force-not-one-backwards-step" data-stratagem-type="strategic-ploy" data-source-label="STRATEGIC PLOY Stratagem"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="space-marines-stratagem-not-one-backwards-step">NOT ONE BACKWARDS STEP</button></h3><span class="stratagem-type">STRATEGIC PLOY Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>Your Command phase.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>One ADEPTUS ASTARTES INFANTRY unit from your army within range 