<article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-adamantine-mantle" data-enhancement-tags="" data-owner-subject="model" data-enhancement-title="Adamantine Mantle"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 20 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="space-marines-enhancement-adamantine-mantle">Adamantine Mantle</button></h4><p data-source-field="text">ADEPTUS ASTARTES model only. Each time an attack is allocated to the bearer, subtract 1 from the Damage characteristic of that attack. If that attack was made with a Melta or Torrent weapon, change the Damage characteristic of that attack to 1 instead.</p></article></div></section><section class="related-detachment" data-detachment="gladius-task-force"><h2>Gladius Task Force <span class="detachment-dp">3DP</span></h2><div data-related-kind="stratagems"><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="gladius-task-force-armour-of-contempt" data-stratagem-type="battle-tactic" data-source-label="BATTLE TACTIC Stratagem"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="space-marines-stratagem-armour-of-contempt-2">ARMOUR OF CONTEMPT</button></h3><span class="stratagem-type">BATTLE TACTIC Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>One ADEPTUS ASTARTES unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>Until the attacking unit has finished making its attacks, each time an attack targets your unit, worsen the Armour Penetration characteristic of that attack by 1.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="gladius-task-force-only-in-death-does-duty-end" data-stratagem-type="epic-deed" data-source-label="EPIC DEED Stratagem"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="space-marines-stratagem-only-in-death-does-duty-end">ONLY IN DEATH DOES DUTY END</button></h3><span class="stratagem-type">EPIC DEED Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">2CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>One ADEPTUS ASTARTES unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit is destroyed, if that model has not fought this phase, do not remove it from play. The destroyed model can fight after the attacking model’s unit has finished making its attacks, and is then removed from play.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="gladius-task-force-honour-the-chapter" data-stratagem-type="battle-tactic" data-source-label="BATTLE TACTIC Stratagem"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="space-marines-stratagem-honour-the-chapter">HONOUR THE CHAPTER</button></h3><span class="stratagem-type">BATTLE TACTIC Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>Fight phase.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>One ADEPTUS ASTARTES unit from your army.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>Until the end of the phase, melee weapons equipped by models in your unit have the [LANCE] ability. If your unit is under the effects of the Assault Doctrine, until the end of the phase, improve the Armour Penetration characteristic of such weapons by 1 as well.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="gladius-task-force-adaptive-strategy" data-stratagem-type="strategic-ploy" data-source-label="STRATEGIC PLOY Stratagem"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="space-marines-stratagem-adaptive-strategy">ADAPTIVE STRATEGY</button></h3><span class="stratagem-type">STRATEGIC PLOY Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>Your Command phase.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>One ADEPTUS ASTARTES unit from your army.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>Select the Devastator Doctrine, Tactical Doctrine or Assault Doctrine. Until the start of your next Command phase, that Combat Doctrine is active for that unit instead of any other Combat Doctrine that is active for your army, even if you have already selected that doctrine this battle.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="gladius-task-force-storm-of-fire" data-stratagem-type="battle-tactic" data-source-label="BATTLE TACTIC Stratagem"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="space-marines-stratagem-storm-of-fire">STORM OF FIRE</button></h3><span class="stratagem-type">BATTLE TACTIC Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>Your Shooting phase.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>One ADEPTUS ASTARTES unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>Until the end of the phase, ranged weapons equipped by models in your unit have the [IGNORES COVER] ability. If your unit is under the effects of the Devastator Doctrine, until the end of the phase, improve the Armour Penetration characteristic of such weapons by 1 as well.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="gladius-task-force-squad-tactics" data-stratagem-type="strategic-ploy" data-source-label="STRATEGIC PLOY Stratagem"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="space-marines-stratagem-squad-tactics">SQUAD TACTICS</button></h3><span class="stratagem-type">STRATEGIC PLOY Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>Your opponent’s Movement phase, just after an enemy unit ends a Normal, Advance or Fall Back move.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>One ADEPTUS ASTARTES INFANTRY or ADEPTUS ASTARTES MOUNTED unit from your army that is within 8&quot; of the enemy unit that just ended that move.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>Your unit can make a Normal move of up to D6&quot;, or a Normal move of up to 6&quot; instead if it is under the effects of the Tactical Doctrine.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="restrictions"><b>Restrictions</b><br>You cannot select a unit that is within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units.</p></article></div><div data-related-kind="enhancements"><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-artificer-armour" data-enhancement-tags="" data-owner-subject="model" data-enhancement-title="Artificer Armour"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 20 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="space-marines-enhancement-artificer-armour">Artificer Armour</button></h4><p data-source-field="text">ADEPTUS ASTARTES model only. The bearer has a Save characteristic of 2+ and the Feel No Pain 5+ ability.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-the-honour-vehement" data-enhancement-tags="" data-owner-subject="model" data-enhancement-title="The Honour Vehement"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 15 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="space-marines-enhancement-the-honour-vehement">The Honour Vehement</button></h4><p data-source-field="text">ADEPTUS ASTARTES model only. Add 1 to the Attacks and Strength characteristics of the bearer’s melee weapons. While the bearer is under the effects of the Assault Doctrine, add 2 to the Attacks and Strength characteristics of the bearers melee weapons instead.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-adept-of-the-codex" data-enhancement-tags="" data-owner-subject="model" data-enhancement-title="Adept of the Codex"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 20 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="space-marines-enhancement-adept-of-the-codex">Adept of the Codex</button></h4><p data-source-field="text">CAPTAIN model only. At the start of your Command phase, if the bearer is on the battlefield, instead of selecting a Combat Doctrine to be active for your army, you can select the Tactical Doctrine. If you do, until the start of your next Command phase, that Combat Doctrine is active for the bearer’s unit only, even if you have already selected that Combat Doctrine to be active for your army this battle.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-fire-discipline" data-enhancement-tags="" data-owner-subject="model" data-enhancement-title="Fire Discipline"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 25 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="space-marines-enhancement-fire-discipline">Fire Discipline</button></h4><p data-source-field="text">ADEPTUS ASTARTES model only. While the bearer is leading a unit, ranged weapons equipped by models in that unit have the [SUSTAINED HITS 1] ability. In addition, while the bearer’s unit is under the effects of the Devastator Doctrine, you can reroll Advance rolls made for that unit.</p></article></div></section><section class="related-detachment" data-detachment="ironstorm-spearhead"><h2>Ironstorm Spearhead <span class="detachment-dp">2DP</span></h2><div data-related-kind="stratagems"><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="ironstorm-spearhead-unbowed-conviction" data-stratagem-type="battle-tactic" data-source-label="BATTLE TACTIC Stratagem"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="t